g\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a1/jbcywka4vj2u51amzfr3tefo4lxcfas.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%BF%83%E4%B9%8B%E6%89%80%E5%90%91.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/a1/jbcywka4vj2u51amzfr3tefo4lxcfas.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />心之所向\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦范围伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>。\n<br />✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协同响应\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">协同响应</font></span></span>]，效果：强制选中自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内最近敌人，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">60%</font>物攻值的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">魔法范围伤害</span>]，每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。\n<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">为这和平的世界</font></span>]，拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协同号令\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">协同号令</font></span></span>]效果。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦范围伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。\n<br />✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协同响应\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">协同响应</font></span></span>]，效果：强制选中自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内最近敌人，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">80%</font>物攻值的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">魔法范围伤害</span>]，每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。\n<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">为这和平的世界</font></span>]，拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协同号令\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">协同号令</font></span></span>]效果。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦范围伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。\n<br />✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协同响应\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">协同响应</font></span></span>]，效果：获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自由意志\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">自由意志</font></span></span>]；之后强制选中自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内最近敌人，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">100%</font>物攻值的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#d68fe2\">魔法范围伤害</font></span>]，每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。\n<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">为这和平的世界</font></span>]，拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协同号令\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">协同号令</font></span></span>]效果。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"苏醒之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8c/9b6ofo1hjm2uz4ayjqfss1bj4be9efe.png/40px-%E8%8B%8F%E9%86%92%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8c/9b6ofo1hjm2uz4ayjqfss1bj4be9efe.png/60px-%E8%8B%8F%E9%86%92%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8c/9b6ofo1hjm2uz4ayjqfss1bj4be9efe.png/80px-%E8%8B%8F%E9%86%92%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，二级：60<img alt=\"苏醒之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8c/9b6ofo1hjm2uz4ayjqfss1bj4be9efe.png/40px-%E8%8B%8F%E9%86%92%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8c/9b6ofo1hjm2uz4ayjqfss1bj4be9efe.png/60px-%E8%8B%8F%E9%86%92%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8c/9b6ofo1hjm2uz4ayjqfss1bj4be9efe.png/80px-%E8%8B%8F%E9%86%9